vely health-tested and certified clear for L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4, ensuring the genetic well-being of our litters. You can find more details on our <a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\" target=\"_blank\" data-type=\"page\" data-id=\"2096\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Staffy Health &amp; Care Page</a>."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "<strong>What is the typical temperament of your blue Staffy puppies?</strong>", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Our <strong>home-raised blue Staffy puppies</strong> are known for their loving, confident, and well-socialized temperaments. Thanks to early exposure to family life and our careful breeding, they are ideal <strong>family dogs UK</strong>, known for their loyalty and playful nature."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can I get a blue Staffy puppy delivered to my home outside Glasgow?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "We offer safe and reliable UK-wide puppy delivery using DEFRA-approved pet transport services. This means whether you're looking for a blue Staffy puppy for sale in the UK, Cornwall, Coventry, or Essex, your new de-wormed Staffy pup can arrive at your doorstep comfortably and securely. Learn more about our process on our Delivery Information Page."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What should a first-time dog owner know before getting a blue Staffy?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "For first-time dog owners, welcoming a blue Staffy is an exciting journey! Key considerations include committing to early socialization, consistent positive training, and providing plenty of exercise. We provide a comprehensive Puppy Care Guide and are always available for advice and support throughout your dog's life, ensuring a smooth transition for both you and your new blue Staffy pup. Find helpful puppy care guidance from the <strong><a href=\"https://www.rspca.org.uk/adviceandwelfare/pets/dogs/puppy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">RSPCA</a></strong>"}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What two breeds make a Staffy? ", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The Staffordshire Bull Terrier evolved in the 19th century in the Black Country of England, primarily from the crossing of the Bulldog and various terriers, particularly the Old English Terrier (now extinct). This combination resulted in a dog with strength, tenacity, and agility. See <strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Staffordshire_Bull_Terrier\">History and characteristics of the Staffordshire Bull Terrier</a></strong>"}}]}]};
const body = "<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-rdam8qxk alignfull uagb-is-root-container\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-binf6pnx\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-z1wkhfxz\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-lpisvufa uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h1 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Home-Raised Blue Staffy Puppies from Glasgow’s Passionate Breeders</h1></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Explore our champion bloodline Staffy pups, raised with health, temperament, and family life in mind. Whether you’re in <a href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffy-puppies-london/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">London</a> or <a href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffy-puppies-south-yorkshire/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Shiefield</a>, we bring our Glasgow-raised Staffies to your door.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"#Staffies-for-sale\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Meet Available Staffies </span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ea92ffd7 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-14dea759 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top wp-block-uagb-info-box--has-margin\"><div class=\"uagb-infobox-margin-wrapper\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">Our Story: A Journey Fueled by Passion: Glasgow’s Trusted Blue Staffy UK Breeders</h2><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">KC‑registered, health‑checked Staffy puppies raised for loving family homes</h3></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-241e8600\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-1ddb2b3d\"><p class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Welcome to <a href=\"/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">BlueStaffyUK.uk</a>, where our lifelong passion for the Staffordshire Bull Terrier breed drives every aspect of our work. As the owner, I believe in raising exceptional <strong>blue Staffy puppies</strong>, rooted in unwavering ethics and a deep love for this magnificent breed. Based in the heart of Glasgow, Scotland, we are committed to upholding the highest standards for responsible breeding throughout the UK. Learn more about breed standards and responsible ownership at <strong><a href=\"https://www.thekennelclub.org.uk/search/breeds-a-to-z/breeds/terrier/staffordshire-bull-terrier/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">The Kennel Club</a></strong></p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-dfe74230\"><p class=\"uagb-heading-text\">I am Sharine Amelia, and my journey with Staffordshire Bull Terriers began years ago, evolving from a profound admiration for their unique temperament and steady loyalty into a dedicated commitment to their welfare and the breed’s excellence, often celebrated at <a href=\"https://crufts.org.uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">prestigious dog events like <strong>Crufts</strong></a>. BlueStaffyUK isn’t just a kennel; it’s a home where every puppy is a cherished member of our family. Our goal is to connect you with a companion who embodies health, happiness, and the true spirit of the Staffy.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-6ghd9tbh alignfull uagb-is-root-container\" id=\"Staffies-for-sale\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-jn7bejmq uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM371.8 211.8C382.7 200.9 382.7 183.1 371.8 172.2C360.9 161.3 343.1 161.3 332.2 172.2L224 280.4L179.8 236.2C168.9 225.3 151.1 225.3 140.2 236.2C129.3 247.1 129.3 264.9 140.2 275.8L204.2 339.8C215.1 350.7 232.9 350.7 243.8 339.8L371.8 211.8z\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\"><strong>Buy a Staffordshire</strong> bull terrier for rehoming<strong> Today – GOING FROM £850 to £1,200!</strong></h2><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong><strong>We’re Ready to Buy! Which Blue Staffy Pups For Sale Are Available Now from Your Reputable UK Staffordshire Bull Terrier Breeders?</strong></strong></h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p><br/>Hey there! Since you’re reviewing our high breeding standards, you’re likely asking about who’s currently ready to join your family. Right now, we have an exceptional, well-socialised litter of <strong>Blue Staffy Pups For Sale</strong>, aged <strong>12 weeks</strong> and priced transparently from <strong>£850 to £1,200</strong>, that showcase the quality and temperament our UK breeders are known for.</p>\n<p>All pups are fully <strong>vaccinated</strong> and <strong>dewormed</strong>, and lovingly exposed to <strong>kids, cats, and seniors</strong>. We make sure the process to find your <strong>Staffy Puppies For Sale Blue</strong> is simple, transparent, and exciting. Scroll down to meet the pups, see their specific attributes, and reserve your favourite today. Ready to Reserve.</p>\n<p>Want to see our pups in action before you enquire? Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bluestaffyukingdom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Instagram @bluestaffyukingdom</strong></a> for daily puppy photos, and catch behind-the-scenes moments on <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@bluestaffyuk.uk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>TikTok @bluestaffyuk.uk</strong></a> — real pups, real stories, no filters.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-n24y3pgl\">\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-neooiepa alignfull uagb-is-root-container\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-oh2i0heb uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Our Ethical Philosophy: Quality, Care &amp; Character</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>At BlueStaffyUK, our philosophy is founded on three core pillars: <strong>health, temperament, and responsible breeding.</strong> We go beyond standard practices to ensure every <strong>blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier pup </strong>we offer is a testament to meticulous care and genetic integrity. We believe that a strong foundation in a loving home environment is crucial for a well-adjusted companion.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Learn More</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 