y</h4></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>As top blue Staffy breeders in the UK, ensuring our blue Staffy puppies’ utmost safety and well-being during transit is our highest priority. That’s why we exclusively partner with DEFRA-approved pet transport services, offering peace of mind whether you’re looking for a Staffordshire <a href=\"/buy-staffy-puppies-for-sale-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bull Terrier puppy for sale</a> in London or a blue Staffy puppy Devon meet-up.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-kexyzpcs alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-et3dqli7 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Safe UK Staffy Transport</h2></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-ms3e6q81 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-2pmlrlic wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-blur wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"BlueStaffyUK.uk branded van delivering blue Staffy puppies nationwide across the UK.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/bluestaffyuk-nationwide-delivery.webp\" srcset=\"/images/bluestaffyuk-nationwide-delivery-760.webp 760w, /images/bluestaffyuk-nationwide-delivery.webp 800w\" width=\"800\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-7s1z4hen\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-bdrdwszk uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-cfc9fb5b24f6b699687662cbfbf325fb\">We understand that finding your perfect <strong>blue Staffy puppy</strong> means looking beyond <strong>Glasgow</strong>. That’s why BlueStaffyUK is proud to offer safe and reliable UK-wide delivery for our <strong>KC-registered Staffy pups</strong>. We partner exclusively with <strong>DEFRA</strong>, ensuring your new family member arrives safely and comfortably at your doorstep. Understand pet travel regulations at <strong><a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/take-pet-abroad\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">DEFRA</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-5b68b0ec3182099948c26e5f03993250\">Whether you’re seeking a <strong>blue Staffy pup for sale</strong> in <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-puppies-for-sale-liverpool/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Liverpool</a></strong>, the beautiful landscapes of <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-puppies-for-sale-cornwall/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Cornwall</a></strong>, the heart of <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/buy-blue-staffy-puppy-coventry-area/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Coventry</a></strong>, or the bustling areas of <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-puppies-for-sale-essex/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Essex</a></strong>, we manage all transport logistics with the utmost care.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link ast-outline-button\" href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"border-width:revert-layer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Blue Staffies Shipped to Your City</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M96 480c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25L242.8 256L73.38 86.63c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0l192 192c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.75 0 45.25l-192 192C112.4 476.9 104.2 480 96 480z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-zohyyvqf alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-kgrse67s\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-5gkbdvvb uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">Meet Our Parents staffies</p><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Meet Our Foundation: Maggie &amp; Jones</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>The heart of our breeding program lies with our exceptional Dam, <strong>Maggie, our beautiful 2-year-old blue Staffy Dam with pups</strong>, and our magnificent Sire, <strong>Jones, our magnificent 3-year-old blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier Sire</strong>. They are beloved members of our family, and their health, temperament, and stunning appearance are passed on to every puppy. Discover their impressive pedigrees and delightful characteristics on our dedicated <strong><a href=\"/uk-locations/staffy-breeding-dogs-glasgow/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Parents Page</a></strong>.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-icon-list uagb-block-0y9duvrr\"><div class=\"uagb-icon-list__wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-icon-list-child uagb-block-95rrutwq\"><span class=\"uagb-icon-list__source-wrap\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"uagb-icon-list__label\">Maggie (Dam): A 2-year-old blue Staffy with a nurturing temperament. Fully health-tested (L-2-HGA &amp; HC-HSF4 clear), KC registered, and raised with love.</span></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-icon-list-child uagb-block-yumue6bn\"><span class=\"uagb-icon-list__source-wrap\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"uagb-icon-list__label\"><strong>Jones (Sire):</strong> A 3-year-old strong and gentle blue male, KC registered with a full pedigree. Health-tested and temperament-assured.</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-5ftawn1l\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-vi2ce5fw wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"Playful blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppy running across a green lawn in the UK\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"794\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/playful-blue-staffy-lawn-uk.webp\" srcset=\"/images/playful-blue-staffy-lawn-uk-760.webp 760w, /images/playful-blue-staffy-lawn-uk.webp 780w\" width=\"780\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-yamrd8kk wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-zoomin wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"Blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier: A beloved family dog in the UK.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/blue-staffy-family-dog-uk.webp\" srcset=\"/images/blue-staffy-family-dog-uk.webp 600w\" width=\"600\"/></figure></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-j77v0phx alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-vavjq3cv uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title-prefix\">Testimonials</p><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Hear From Our Happy Families</h2></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">Don’t just take our word for it! The joy our puppies bring to their new homes speaks volumes.</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-mxprchsx\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-6k0vtpa2\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-star-rating uagb-block-ndxm8s7r\"><div class=\"uag-star-rating\" title=\"5/5\"><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-3lggn7al uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">“Our Blue Staffy from BlueStaffyUK is the most loving, intelligent dog we could have ever asked for. The support from [Sharine Amelia] during and after the adoption was incredible!” </p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-elyqmxcq uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-image-content\"><img alt=\"ALT Text: A cheerful family, possibly with children, enjoying time with their healthy blue Staffy, representing trusted UK breeders.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/trusted-uk-breeders-blue-staffy-family.webp\" srcset=\"/images/trusted-uk-breeders-blue-staffy-family.webp 450w\" width=\"450\"/></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>— Sarah T., Birmingham</strong></p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-yquf6dd2\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-star-rating uagb-block-594ajecd\"><div class=\"uag-star-rating\" title=\"5/5\"><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span><span class=\"uag-star\">★</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-nxuns6p1 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">“As a first-time dog owner, I was nervous, but BlueStaffyUK’s guidance and the amazing temperament of my Staffy pup made it so easy. Highly recommend!” </p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-ogzntncy uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-image-content\"><img alt=\"David, a new owner from Southampton, playing gently with his **KC registered Staffy pup**, emphasizing the puppy's playful temperament.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/testimonial-david-southampton-staffy-pup.webp\" srcset=\"/images/testimonial-david-southampton-staffy-pup.webp 450w\" width=\"450\"/></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><p class=\"uagb-ifb-title\"><strong>— David M., Southampton</strong></p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-s1rdtirg alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-w4btfhkr wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"A breeder holding a blue Staffy puppy, smiling, in a home environment, Responsible breeders of blue Staffies L-2-HGA clear.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/breeder-sitting-blue-staffy-puppy-home.webp\" srcset=\"/images/breeder-sitting-blue-staffy-puppy-home.webp 640w\" width=\"640\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-4dboolai\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-kjpwfhqf uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Our Commitment to Every Family</h2></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Whether you are a <strong>first-time dog owner</strong> or an <strong>experienced Staffy enthusiast</strong>, we are dedicated to matching our healthy, happy Staffy pups with the perfect responsible home. We understand the specific needs of families looking to <strong><a href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-puppy-buying-guide/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">buy a Staffordshire Bull Terrier</a> in the UK</strong> and strive to make the process transparent and supportive from start to finish. Our <strong>vet-checked Staffy pups,</strong> 12 weeks old, are prepared to bring immense joy and loyalty to your family for years to come.</p>\n<p></p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"/uk-blue-staffy-breeders-contact/\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">Learn More</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-8u6zr8h3 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Ethical Breeding Commitment</h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>As one of the <a href=\"/uk-locations/uk-staffordshire-bull-terrier-breeder/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">trusted <strong>KC Staffy breeders in the UK</strong></a>, we operate with full transparency. Our breeding practices are ethical and fully compliant with all standards. Every litter is raised with structure, early socialisation, and health-focused routines.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-5thicyd0 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Support Beyond the Sale</h3></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>We don’t just hand over your puppy and say goodbye. As ethical blue Staffy breeders with health clearances, we offer ongoing support, care guides, and a full <a href=\"/uk-staffordshire-bull-terrier-guide/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">UK Staffy information guide</a> to ensure your puppy thrives in its forever home.</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-g3jbzyxd alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-ojknhxvf\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Frequently Asked Questions: Your Peace of Mind with BlueStaffyUK</h2><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">To help you feel completely confident in choosing a <strong>blue Staffy puppy</strong> from us, we’ve answered some of the most common questions about our <strong>ethical breeding</strong> practices, <strong>health protocols</strong>, and commitment as <strong>blue Staffy UK breeders</strong>.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq uagb-faq__outer-wrap uagb-block-kr3vcxxa uagb-faq-icon-row-reverse uagb-faq-layout-accordion uagb-faq-expand-first-false uagb-faq-inactive-other-true uagb-faq__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap uagb-faq-equal-height\" role=\"tablist\"><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-7l3b08z0\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224 416c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375l-192-192c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0L224 338.8l169.4-169.4c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0s12.5 32.75 0 45.25l-192 192C240.4 412.9 232.2 416 224 416z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 352c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375L224 173.3l-169.4 169.4c-12.5 12.5-32.75 12.5-45.25 0s-12.5-32.75 0-45.25l192-192c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0l192 192c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.75 0 45.25C432.4 348.9 424.2 352 416 352z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<h3 class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What makes BlueStaffyUK an ethical blue Staffy breeder in Glasgow?</strong></h3></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p> We prioritise the welfare, health, and temperament of our parent dogs above all else. This means comprehensive health testing for our Dam (Maggie) and Sire (Jones), <strong>KC registration</strong>, raising puppies in a loving home environment, and providing lifelong support to our families. We are dedicated to transparent and responsible practices. </p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-jnnrt8cl\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224 416c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375l-192-192c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0L224 338.8l169.4-169.4c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0s12.5 32.75 0 45.25l-192 192C240.4 412.9 232.2 416 224 416z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 352c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375L224 173.3l-169.4 169.4c-12.5 12.5-32.75 12.5-45.25 0s-12.5-32.75 0-45.25l192-192c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0l192 192c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.75 0 45.25C432.4 348.9 424.2 352 416 352z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<h3 class=\"uagb-question\">Are your Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppies health-tested?</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Absolutely. The health of our blue Staffies is paramount. Both Maggie and Jones are extensively health-tested and certified clear for L-2-HGA and HC-HSF4, ensuring the genetic well-being of our litters. You can find more details on our <a href=\"/blue-staffy-health-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Staffy Health &amp; Care Page</a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-iq65jcck\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224 416c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375l-192-192c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0L224 338.8l169.4-169.4c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0s12.5 32.75 0 45.25l-192 192C240.4 412.9 232.2 416 224 416z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 352c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375L224 173.3l-169.4 169.4c-12.5 12.5-32.75 12.5-45.25 0s-12.5-32.75 0-45.25l192-192c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0l192 192c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.75 0 45.25C432.4 348.9 424.2 352 416 352z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<h3 class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What is the typical temperament of your blue Staffy puppies?</strong></h3></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Our <strong>home-raised blue Staffy puppies</strong> are known for their loving, confident, and well-socialized temperaments. Thanks to early exposure to family life and our careful breeding, they are ideal <strong>family dogs UK</strong>, known for their loyalty and playful nature.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-08umblqg\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224 416c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375l-192-192c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0L224 338.8l169.4-169.4c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0s12.5 32.75 0 45.25l-192 192C240.4 412.9 232.2 416 224 416z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 352c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375L224 173.3l-169.4 169.4c-12.5 12.5-32.75 12.5-45.25 0s-12.5-32.75 0-45.25l192-192c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0l192 192c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.75 0 45.25C432.4 348.9 424.2 352 416 352z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<h3 class=\"uagb-question\">Can I get a blue Staffy puppy delivered to my home outside Glasgow?</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>We offer safe and reliable UK-wide puppy delivery using DEFRA-approved pet transport services. This means whether you’re looking for a blue Staffy puppy for sale in the UK, Cornwall, Coventry, or Essex, your new de-wormed Staffy pup can arrive at your doorstep comfortably and securely. Learn more about our process on our Delivery Information Page.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-mucxbl9w\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224 416c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375l-192-192c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0L224 338.8l169.4-169.4c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0s12.5 32.75 0 45.25l-192 192C240.4 412.9 232.2 416 224 416z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 352c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375L224 173.3l-169.4 169.4c-12.5 12.5-32.75 12.5-45.25 0s-12.5-32.75 0-45.25l192-192c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0l192 192c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.75 0 45.25C432.4 348.9 424.2 352 416 352z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<h3 class=\"uagb-question\">What should a first-time dog owner know before getting a blue Staffy?</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>For first-time dog owners, welcoming a blue Staffy is an exciting journey! Key considerations include committing to early socialization, consistent positive training, and providing plenty of exercise. We provide a comprehensive Puppy Care Guide and are always available for advice and support throughout your dog’s life, ensuring a smooth transition for both you and your new blue Staffy pup. Find helpful puppy care guidance from the <strong><a href=\"https://www.rspca.org.uk/adviceandwelfare/pets/dogs/puppy\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">RSPCA</a></strong></p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-pjzlpwoj\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M224 416c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375l-192-192c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.75 0-45.25s32.75-12.5 45.25 0L224 338.8l169.4-169.4c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0s12.5 32.75 0 45.25l-192 192C240.4 412.9 232.2 416 224 416z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 352c-8.188 0-16.38-3.125-22.62-9.375L224 173.3l-169.4 169.4c-12.5 12.5-32.75 12.5-45.25 0s-12.5-32.75 0-45.25l192-192c12.5-12.5 32.75-12.5 45.25 0l192 192c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.75 0 45.25C432.4 348.9 424.2 352 416 352z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<h3 class=\"uagb-question\">What two breeds make a Staffy? </h3></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>The Staffordshire Bull Terrier evolved in the 19th century in the Black Country of England, primarily from the crossing of the Bulldog and various terriers, particularly the Old English Terrier (now extinct). This combination resulted in a dog with strength, tenacity, and agility. See <strong><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Staffordshire_Bull_Terrier\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">History and characteristics of the Staffordshire Bull Terrier</a></strong></p></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-kj8levd4 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-0jzw783c uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h2 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Our Staffy Audience</h2></div><p class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">We proudly work with:</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-hfmvlzep\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-bcxmntbr uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p><strong>Families with children</strong> looking for a playful, loving pet</p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-bofdkt8y uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-left-title uagb-infobox-left uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-left-title-image\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-icon-wrap\"><div class=\"uagb-iconbox-icon-wrap uagb-infobox-shape-circle\"><svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M438.6 105.4C451.1 117.9 451.1 138.1 438.6 150.6L182.6 406.6C170.1 419.1 149.9 419.1 137.4 406.6L9.372 278.6C-3.124 266.1-3.124 245.9 9.372 233.4C21.87 220.9 42.13 220.9 54.63 233.4L159.1 338.7L393.4 105.4C405.9 92.88 426.1 92.88 438.6 105.4H438.6z\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"></div></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p><